{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/516770-is-there-an-eta-for-the-changeling-20-kickstarter","id":516770,"title":"Is There An ETA for the Changeling 20 Kickstarter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-16T23:07:36-07:00","id":516770,"title":"Is There An ETA for the Changeling 20 Kickstarter?","content":"I see on the Current Projects page, listed under <b>Fall 2015 (October/November/December)</b><br /><br /> <b>Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition</b>: A letter of love to our Dreaming fans.<br /> In style and philosophy a matching volume to V20. <i>Developer: Matt McFarland. PDF/PoD/Deluxe Kickstarter.</i><br /> <br /> Wedged between two Changeling the Lost titles.<br /> <br /> I guess I'm wondering, since the Mage 20 has yet to be released, and the Wraith 20 now going through its preliminary stages, should we just assume the Kickstarter for Changeling 20 to begin in December ending in January, as did Wraith? -- Or will there be a possible Autumn/Equinox (fitting for Changeling) date?<br /> <br /> I'm just curious, as, I'm trying to guesstimate when to ready my wallet for this endeavor, especially if the projection is in December, which conflicts with Holiday spending.<br /> <br /> Thanx to anyone who can answer.<br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6040-quiet-storm","name":"Quiet Storm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-17T00:39:13-07:00","id":516847,"title":"","content":"Matt finished the outline this previous week, so it's going to be some while, as it's just entered production. Let's see... Beast: the Primordial is the next KS, then there's GenCon, Eddy Webb's looking at crowdfunding for Pugmire, depends whether he does that through Onyx Path, possibly Dragon-Blooded for Exalted before CtD... I'd expect November-January for the Dreaming KS.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-17T14:43:56-07:00","id":517366,"title":"","content":"I'm particularly excited for this one. WtO was always my favourite, but I felt Second Edition was pretty damn good already. Meanwhile, CtD Second Edition definitely had a few kinks that needed to be fixed. I think CtD20 will be particularly important because of this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-17T15:10:39-07:00","id":517373,"title":"","content":"Although I am a fan of all the classic World of Darkness line (save demon), I agree.<br /> <br /> I've been waiting for the Changeling 20 with anticipation.<br /> <br /> I got so far behind with this game line, I didn't even know about the Vampire Kickstarter until after the Werewolf 20 book had been funded. Today I own both core 20 books and six of the support books for the game lines (4 of which are Werewolf) all from PoD -- With Mage, I was unaware they even decided to go through with a Kickstarter until after Wraith &amp; Changeling were announced, meaning the Mage 20 book was already in development -- With Wraith, it was either help to Kickstart that, or buy my 3d Printer, which I saw Wraith had gotten its full funding in 69 minutes, so I went 3D Printer (sorry Wraith).<br /> <br /> Basically, I guess I'm saying, I would have been involved with all of the Kickstarters, but my timing was always off -- Not with Changeling, though. This 1 I'm keeping my eye on. I'm going $300 to $500 in on this one, and I hope they make all of their stretch goals.<br /> <br /> Here's to you Children of the Wyld.<br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6040-quiet-storm","name":"Quiet Storm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T00:04:54-08:00","id":783270,"title":"","content":"Apparently within a 16 hours or so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T00:05:51-08:00","id":7